OL,3,AUK net migration drops to lowest level
OL,4,Asince 1997 as number of people claiming
OL,5,Aasylum also falls
OL,6,
OL,7,FUK net migration fell to 77,000 in the
OL,8,Fyear to June 2026, the lowest it's been
OL,9,Fsince 1997 apart from in the Covid
OL,10,Fpandemic
OL,12,FThe fall was mainly driven by fewer
OL,13,Fpeople from outside Europe coming to
OL,14,Fthe UK - here's a recap of the latest
OL,15,Fdata
OL,17,FMeanwhile, Home Office figures show the
OL,18,Fnumber of people claiming asylum in the
OL,19,FUK dropped by a third in the year
OL,20,Fending September 2026 - but appeals are
OL,21,Fon the rise
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
