OL,3,AUK net migration drops to lowest level
OL,4,Asince 1997 as number of people claiming
OL,5,Aasylum also falls
OL,6,
OL,7,FAlysha, from Leeds, tells us she left
OL,8,Fthe UK for Malaysia in May due to the
OL,9,Fcost of living: "I get a lot more for
OL,10,Fmy money and I just have a way better
OL,11,Fquality of life"
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/40
