OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ANew Mandelson papers reveal government
OL,4,Aconcerns over his shares in lobbying
OL,5,Afirm
OL,6,
OL,7,FAnother file shows an email exchange
OL,8,Ffrom April 2025 with an unnamed "US
OL,9,Fgovernment official", where Mandelson
OL,10,Frefers to a meeting that discussed
OL,11,F"alternative options" to the World
OL,12,FTrade Organization
OL,14,FThe official says it was a "delight" to
OL,15,Fmeet Mandelson, adding: "'Prince of
OL,16,FDarkness' couldn't be farther from the
OL,17,Ftruth!"
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/40
