OL,3,AUK reservists contacted as 'threat
OL,4,Aenvironment' rises, Streeting says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Ministry of Defence has written to
OL,7,Fex-military personnel to check their
OL,8,Fcontact details and skills against the
OL,9,Fbackdrop of a rising "threat
OL,10,Fenvironment", Defence Secretary Wes
OL,11,FStreeting has said.
OL,13,FIt comes after The Times and the
OL,14,FTelegraph reported that reservists who
OL,15,Fpreviously served in the Armed Forces
OL,16,Fhave received letters telling them to
OL,17,Fprepare to be called up for war.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
