OL,3,AMyanmar refuses to comply with parts of
OL,4,AICJ genocide ruling
OL,5,
OL,6,FMyanmar will not comply with
OL,7,F"inappropriate" parts of the genocide
OL,8,Fruling by the International Court of
OL,9,FJustice (ICJ), its leader Min Aung
OL,10,FHlaing has said in his first public
OL,11,Fcomments since the court decision.
OL,13,FThe ICJ's landmark ruling last week
OL,14,Ffound Myanmar guilty of committing
OL,15,Fgenocide against its Rohingya minority
OL,16,Fin a 2017 military crackdown that
OL,17,Fkilled thousands and forced more than
OL,18,F700,000 to flee.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
