OL,3,ADesperate appeals from women on death
OL,4,Arow in Iran after protests
OL,5,
OL,6,FTaraneh Rahimi is on death row in Iran.
OL,8,FIn recent weeks, the 21-year-old has
OL,9,Fbeen unable to walk properly after her
OL,10,Flegs were beaten, and an ear-infection
OL,11,Fcaused by an untreated head injury has
OL,12,Faffected her balance, her cousin says.
OL,14,FShe is "keeping her spirits up" but
OL,15,F"there are days she breaks down in
OL,16,Ftears," Masoud Nourmohammadi tells BBC
OL,17,FNews Persian.
OL,19,FHe says Taraneh and her twin sister
OL,20,FRomina were arrested after joining the
OL,21,Fanti-government protests that swept the
OL,22,Fcountry in January.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/40
